\title{Minimum-weight spanning subgraph}
\date{2026-10-09T02:39:44Z}
\tag{algorithms}
\taxon{Definition}

\import{algorithms-macros}

\p{A \em{minimum-weight spanning subgraph} (MWSS) of an undirected, [weighted graph](00NP) #{G} is a [spanning subgraph](00OA) with the smallest possible \em{total} weight.}
